<style>
  body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #333;
  }
  h2 {
    color: #004aad;
  }
  h3 {
    color: #0056b3;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
  }
  h4 {
    color: #333;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  p {
    margin: 5px 0;
  }
  .section {
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }
  .highlight {
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #000;
  }
  .consent-box {
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
    padding: 15px;
    border-left: 4px solid #004aad;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  hr {
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
</style>

<h2>New DSAR Request</h2>

<div class="section">
  <h3>Submitted User Details</h3>
  <p><span class="highlight">Name:</span> <%= fullName %></p>
  <p><span class="highlight">Email:</span> <%= email %></p>
  <p><span class="highlight">Country:</span> <%= country %></p>
  <p><span class="highlight">Request Types:</span> <%= requestTypes %></p>
  <p><span class="highlight">Notes:</span> <%= notes %></p>
  <p><span class="highlight">Domain:</span> <%= domainName %></p>
  <p><span class="highlight">CMP User ID:</span> <%= cmpUserId %></p>
</div>

<hr />

<div class="section">
  <h3>Consent Form</h3>

  <div class="consent-box">
    <p>This consent form is issued to inform you of the purposes for which your personal data
      will be processed and to obtain your explicit consent for the same, in compliance with
      the <strong>Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (“DPDPA”)</strong>.
    </p>

    <h4>1. Information We Will Collect</h4>
    <p><strong>Basic Information:</strong> Full legal name, residential address, personal email, date of birth, mobile number.</p>
    <p><strong>Financial Details:</strong> Bank account numbers, payment card details, billing information.</p>
    <p><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP addresses, device identifiers, interaction logs.</p>

    <h4>2. Purpose of Processing</h4>
    <p><strong>Service Provision:</strong> To provide requested services or products.</p>
    <p><strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> To comply with applicable laws and regulations.</p>
    <p><strong>Marketing Communications:</strong> To send marketing materials (with explicit consent).</p>
    <p><strong>Data Analytics:</strong> To improve services, products, and user experience.</p>

    <h4>3. Legal Basis for Processing</h4>
    <p>Your consent is free, specific, informed, unconditional, and unambiguous as per Section 6 of DPDPA.</p>

    <h4>4. Rights Available to You</h4>
    <p>You have the following rights under DPDPA:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Access your data and processing activities</li>
      <li>Correct or complete your personal data</li>
      <li>Request erasure of unnecessary data</li>
      <li>Withdraw consent anytime (without affecting prior processing)</li>
      <li>Nominate someone to exercise your rights in case of death/incapacity</li>
      <li>Register grievances with the Data Fiduciary</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>5. Consent Declaration</h4>
    <p>
      By submitting this request, you confirm that you have read and understood the consent form
      and agree to the processing of your personal data as described.
    </p>
    <p>
      I, <strong><%= fullName %></strong>, using the email address <strong><%= email %></strong>,
      hereby give my free, specific, informed, unconditional, and unambiguous consent to
      [Insert Organisation Name] for processing my personal data for the purposes mentioned above.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>